:: Carter House Lounge By Pool [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 20>>
/* Intro */

Feeling tired from all the outdoor activity, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if you can take a short break. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure thing, I could use a little rest myself, haha.”</span> He says, motioning you over to the deck chairs by the pool, which you both plop yourselves down into. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

The two of you lie there for a while, casually chatting about whatever comes to mind. Though you don’t really talk about anything of note, <span style="color:LightGreen">you enjoy your time chatting with Carter regardless. You feel a little more rested as you get back up again, eager to continue playing once more.</span>
<br>
<<needChange "Energy" 10>>
<span style="color:green">+Carter Energy</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Energy += 10>>
